-The device should be able to be switched in and out of BLE mode
    -When a BLE message is received it should automatically switch 
    -To switch back, changing the effect or turing the LEDs on and off again should switch it back to controls

-We need a menu to change modes
    -The buttons should direct you through the menu
        -button to scroll down
        -another button to change the setting
        -Switch Display Off/On
        -to restart? ESP.restart();
    -Settings:
        -LEDs On/Off
        -Colour source: Controls/BLE(if available)/Color Temperature/DMX Mode (will need a DMX starting address)
        -Light Effect: (Scroll through all the available effects)
        -Set Colour Temp: 1000K-9000K
    